msgstr "An Ƙara Jadawali zuwa QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s added to QuickTree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "An ƙara jadawali %s zuwa QuickTree.  Je zuwa shafin QuickTree don matsar da duka jadawalai zuwa sabuwar bishiya ko wadda ke akwai."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Ba a Ƙara Jadawali zuwa QuickTree Ba"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s was NOT added to QuickTree as it's already there waiting to be placed on a Tree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "BA a ƙara jadawali %s zuwa QuickTree ba domin ya riga ya kasance a can yana jiran a sanya shi a kan Bishiya.  Je zuwa shafin QuickTree don matsar da duka jadawalai zuwa sabuwar bishiya ko wadda ke akwai."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Specified.  Not added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Ba a Ƙayyade Jadawali Ba.  Ba a ƙara zuwa QuickTree ba"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "No Graph was added to QuickTree as no Graph was specified."
msgstr "Ba a ƙara kowane Jadawali zuwa QuickTree ba domin ba a ƙayyade kowane Jadawali ba."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree."
msgstr "Danna 'Ci gaba' don Ƙara wannan Bishiya da ke ƙasa."

