msgstr "Ci gaba"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree Branch."
msgstr "Danna 'Ci gaba' don Ƙara wannan Reshen Bishiya da ke ƙasa."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add to which Graph Tree?"
msgstr "A ƙara zuwa wace Bishiyar Jadawali?"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has Created Tree and/or Branch and added Graphs"
msgstr "QuickTree ya Ƙirƙiri Bishiya da/ko Reshe kuma ya ƙara Jadawalai"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has no Graphs Queued"
msgstr "QuickTree ba shi da Jadawalai a cikin Layi"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Information/Directions"
msgstr "Bayani/Jagora"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "The Graphs below are Queue to be added to a Cacti Tree.  You may keep them here for as long as you like, or you can perform one of the following actions"
msgstr "Jadawalan da ke ƙasa suna cikin layi don a ƙara su zuwa Bishiyar Cacti.  Kuna iya ajiye su a nan tsawon lokacin da kuke so, ko kuma ku yi ɗaya daga cikin ayyukan da ke ƙasa"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection to a new Graph Tree so you can keep them for later and work on something new."
msgstr "Ajiye zaɓinku zuwa sabuwar Bishiyar Jadawali don ku adana su don amfani a gaba sannan ku yi aiki kan wani sabon abu."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection as a branch to an existing tree so that they appear in a specific section of an existing tree."
msgstr "Ajiye zaɓinku a matsayin reshe a cikin bishiyar da ke akwai domin su bayyana a wani takamaiman sashe na bishiyar da ke akwai."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear all graphs"
msgstr "Share duka jadawalai"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear the Graphs on this page from the Graphs Queue so that you have a blank QuickTree ready for new selections"
msgstr "Share Jadawalan da ke kan wannan shafin daga Layin Jadawalai domin ku sami QuickTree marar komai a shirye don sabbin zaɓuka"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "You can manage the individual graphs that appear here by clicking:"
msgstr "Kuna iya sarrafa kowane jadawali da ya bayyana a nan ta danna:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Ƙara"

#: quicktree.php
