msgstr "Shafin Kallon Jadawali"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "This icon is next to a Graph on the %s tab."
msgstr "Wannan alamar tana kusa da Jadawali a shafin %s."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Share"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "This icon next to the Graphs below to remove them from the QuickTree Queue."
msgstr "Wannan alamar da ke kusa da Jadawalan da ke ƙasa don cire su daga Layin QuickTree."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Lura:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Adding, removing or clearing on this page does not affect any other parts of Cacti (only Creating/Saving does)"
msgstr "Ƙarawa, cirewa ko sharewa a kan wannan shafin ba ya shafar sauran sassan Cacti (Ƙirƙira/Ajiye ne kawai ke yi)"

